    "season_or_time_rule": "Where rights-bearing supply permits, each province must include at least two separated capture months and two broad seasons. Missing metadata remains unknown and is never inferred; an unmet stratum is reported as a coverage limitation.",
    "source_balance_rule": "No source may fill more than 60 percent of an option unless the corpus is first-party-only and the exception is declared before acquisition. Source-specific immutable partitions remain independently removable.",
    "sequence_cap": "No single sequence or capture run may contribute more than 2 percent of an option or 10 percent of a province quota, whichever admits fewer assets.",
    "duplicate_rule": "An asset may have exactly one primary tier and one role; exact or near-duplicate bytes are not counted twice when they satisfy multiple strata."
